  '大堡礁':'Great Barrier Reef','马丘比丘':'Machu Picchu','吴哥窟':'Angkor Wat','蒲甘':'Bagan',
  '阿尔卑斯':'Alps','阿尔卑斯山':'Alps','富士山':'Mount Fuji','乞力马扎罗':'Kilimanjaro',
